\details{
For a joint intensity bounded by \eqn{\lambda_{\max}} on an augmented domain
\eqn{\mathcal{D}}, the algorithm first generates

\deqn{N^\star\sim\mathrm{Poisson}(\lambda_{\max}|\mathcal{D}|)}

